  "answers": [
    {
      "pdfId": "7293e2a2261f426fbdda52a3fee8f0da",
      "sourceSha256": "c120dda2ffb3913de8cb86c62b76e21248ba4bd9246b03c14b61ec0ac3b44576",
      "q": 12,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "<span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></span>. מצמצמים 14 עם 28 ו־15 עם 25 לפני הכפל; מתקבלים המונים 1 ו־3 והמכנים 5 ו־2. אין צמצום נוסף כי 3 ו־10 זרים."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "7293e2a2261f426fbdda52a3fee8f0da",
      "sourceSha256": "c120dda2ffb3913de8cb86c62b76e21248ba4bd9246b03c14b61ec0ac3b44576",
      "q": 19,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "אומדן חסר: <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">5</span></span></span>; אומדן יתר: <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">2</span><span class=\"fden\">3</span></span></span>; תוצאה מדויקת: <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">11</span><span class=\"fden\">18</span></span></span>. אכן <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">5</span></span> < <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">11</span><span class=\"fden\">18</span></span> < <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">2</span><span class=\"fden\">3</span></span></span>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "e38b2869141b41fb9f000c5cd3dcad50",
      "sourceSha256": "4bef19dca2ff0ec82ce5865fb03b6f7c624ad42f4f95a0d0894db326962d1775",
      "q": 19,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "התוצאה <span class=\"ltr\">7 <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">5</span></span></span>; האומדן לשלם הקרוב הוא 7, ושגיאתו <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">5</span></span></span>. אם האומדן הראשוני נעשה בעיגול כל גורם לשלם הקרוב, מתקבל <span class=\"ltr\">2 x 3 = 6</span> ושגיאתו <span class=\"ltr\">1 <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">5</span></span></span>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "5e27f374f1174eb5bb599e0f376b44d7",
      "sourceSha256": "ea32b43c419d65288f824299408e2bd2b729e04df655b9a92116ee85c4f63fdd",
      "q": 13,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "המכפלה היא 4. <span class=\"ltr\">1 <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">5</span><span class=\"fden\">9</span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">14</span><span class=\"fden\">9</span></span></span> מתאים לשלם ולחמש תשיעיות; במכפלה <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">14</span><span class=\"fden\">9</span></span> x <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">18</span><span class=\"fden\">7</span></span></span> מצמצמים 14 עם 7 ו־18 עם 9 ומקבלים <span class=\"ltr\">2 x 2 = 4</span>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "8ef7dfbb350a4928a398258415f2f192",
      "sourceSha256": "3280d1dd2ae90c3982e590ce18486781f0a48b0c5419cb1e589cd54e3d6e1587",
      "q": 9,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "הגורם החסר הוא <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">9</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></span>. בדיקה: <span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">7</span><span class=\"fden\">12</span></span> x <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">9</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">21</span><span class=\"fden\">40</span></span></span>. הוא יחיד כי כפל במספר חיובי שאינו אפס הוא הפיך; חלוקת שני האגפים ב־<span class=\"ltr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"fnum\">7</span><span class=\"fden\">12</span></span></span> קובעת ערך יחיד."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "1ea1f15a94f34e66b8c2be73548ffc5a",
      "sourceSha256": "8332a1df789d2716c440e953f50410f55406db1bfb8b55233190e51c28c589e3",
      "q": 5,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "אומדנים באמצעות שלמים סמוכים: <span class=\"ltr\">2 x 3 = 6</span> ו־<span class=\"ltr\">3 x 4 = 12</span>. התוצאה <span class=\"ltr\">9.72</span> נמצאת ביניהם. שגיאת אומדן החסר 6 היא <span class=\"ltr\">3.72</span>; שגיאת אומדן היתר 12 היא <span class=\"ltr\">2.28</span>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "2feaa550e5624413850647e884ea7076",
      "sourceSha256": "e613559a481ef9e807af693e745ae7278f531c64ded486044126f0448784fc27",
      "q": 5,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "אומדן חסר: <span class=\"ltr\">2.4 x 3.1 = 7.44</span>; אומדן יתר: <span class=\"ltr\">2.5 x 3.2 = 8</span>. התוצאה <span class=\"ltr\">7.791</span>, ואכן <span class=\"ltr\">7.44 < 7.791 < 8</span>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "7ad8b30e2e8f4e64b089a3233e7e6beb",
      "sourceSha256": "c2a6aecaa4e40e55dec59b84ff539bd02d64dd6c6e57af44fa005389010bc0a2",
      "q": 5,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "אומדן חסר 5 ואומדן יתר <span class=\"ltr\">5.5</span>; המנה המדויקת <span class=\"ltr\">5.25</span>. הבדיקה <span class=\"ltr\">5 x 5.4 = 27 < 28.35 < 29.7 = 5.5 x 5.4</span> ממקמת את המנה בין האומדנים."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "7ad8b30e2e8f4e64b089a3233e7e6beb",
      "sourceSha256": "c2a6aecaa4e40e55dec59b84ff539bd02d64dd6c6e57af44fa005389010bc0a2",
      "q": 12,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "המנה <span class=\"ltr\">5.5</span>. בדיקת כפל: <span class=\"ltr\">5.5 x 2.6 = 14.3</span>. חיסור חוזר מקוצר: <span class=\"ltr\">14.3 − 5 x 2.6 = 1.3</span>, ו־<span class=\"ltr\">1.3</span> הוא חצי מ־<span class=\"ltr\">2.6</span>; לכן יש 5 קבוצות ועוד חצי."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdfId": "7ad8b30e2e8f4e64b089a3233e7e6beb",
      "sourceSha256": "c2a6aecaa4e40e55dec59b84ff539bd02d64dd6c6e57af44fa005389010bc0a2",
      "q": 18,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "",
          "html": "המנה <span class=\"ltr\">5.5</span> כי <span class=\"ltr\">5.5 x 2.8 = 15.4</span>. היא באמצע בין 5 ל־6: <span class=\"ltr\">5.5 − 5 = 6 − 5.5 = 0.5</span>."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
